<title>RUSSIA: Russian gem deal with De Beers signed soon-Chubais.</title>
<headline>Russian gem deal with De Beers signed soon-Chubais.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia will sign a stalled gem deal with South Africa's De Beers and a decree outlining diamond export quotas for 1997 soon, First Deputy Prime Minister Anatoly Chubais said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;In principal the decisions have been made, and will be signed soon,&quot; he told a news conference.</p>
</text>
